Introspect Gazebo topics
Usage: /usr/libexec/gz/transport13/gz-transport-topic [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h [--help]                 Print this help message and exit
                              
  -v [--version]              
                              
  -t [--topic] TEXT           Name of a topic.
                              Required by: --info
                              Required by: --pub
                              Required by: --frequency
                              Required by: --echo
                              
  -m [--msgtype] TEXT         Type of message to publish.
                              Required by: --pub
                              
  -d [--duration] FLOAT       Duration (seconds) to run.
                              Excludes: --num
                              
  -n [--num] INT              Number of messages to echo and then exit.
                              Excludes: --duration
                              
[Option Group: command]
  Command to be executed.
  Options:
    -l [--list]                 List all topics.
                                
    -i [--info]                 Get info about a topic. E.g.:
                                  gz topic -i -t /foo
                                Requires: --topic
                                
    -e [--echo]                 Output data to screen. E.g.:
                                  gz topic -e -t /foo
                                Requires: --topic
                                
    -f [--frequency]            Calculate the frequency of a topic:
                                  gz topic -f -t /foo
                                Requires: --topic
                                
    --json-output               Output messages in JSON format.
                                
    -p [--pub] TEXT             Publish a message.
                                TEXT is the message data. The format expected is
                                the same used by google::protobuf::TextFormat::PrintToString(). E.g.:
                                  gz topic -t /foo -m gz.msgs.StringMsg \
                                    -p 'data:"Custom data"'
                                Requires: --topic
                                Requires: --msgtype
                                

